[{"title":"Software Development Testing Engineer (SDET)","company":"Rudr Consultancy Services","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-software-development-testing-engineer-sdet-rudr-consultancy-services-ahmedabad-3-to-8-years-160926937656","source":"naukri","experience":"3-8 Yrs","skills":[1,30],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Skills: DB / ETL testing,Python+Pytest or coding any programming language,API automation Experience3- 8 year SalaryBest in the Industry EducationBCA,MCA,B.tech (CS / IT) . Job Summary: We are looking for a meticulous SDET to contribute to and review the creation of designs for production software\n\nBCA,MCA,B.tech (CS / IT). .\n\nKey Skills: python,pytest,api automation,etl testing,db,test scenarios,software development,software testing"},{"title":"Senior QA Automation Engineer","company":"Jetbro","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-senior-qa-automation-engineer-jetbro-ahmedabad-4-to-5-years-160926502820","source":"naukri","experience":"4-5 Yrs","skills":[1,19],"is_walkin":false,"description":"Senior QA Automation Engineer Location: Gujarat, India Job Type: Full time Work Experience: 4-5 years This role is part of Jetbros engagement with Safal, where we are building and evolving an enterprise SaaS platform used to manage procurement workflows, approvals, and business operations. Quality assurance at Safal is not about simply running test cases. It is about deeply understanding business workflows, ensuring system reliability, and building automated testing systems that help the product evolve safely and confidently. We are looking for a Senior QA Automation Engineer with 35 years of experience who can combine structured manual testing with strong automation capabilities. The Safal platform includes multi-role procurement workflows, approval chains, and enterprise-level system logic. The QA engineer must be able to understand these workflows deeply and validate that the system behaves correctly across multiple roles, conditions, and edge cases. This role requires someone who is comfortable working with developers, writing structured documentation, and gradually automating QA processes. We are particularly looking for candidates who actively use modern automation tools and AI-assisted workflows to improve QA productivity, automate documentation, generate test cases, and build strong test coverage systems. Key Responsibilities Write structured test cases for product features and workflows Build and maintain automation test suites using Playwright, Selenium, or similar frameworks Perform exploratory testing to identify edge cases and unexpected behavior Conduct regression testing across product releases Test APIs and backend services using tools such as Postman Validate multi-role workflows, permissions, and approval logic Ensure data integrity across workflows and system actions Collaborate with developers during issue identification and resolution Contribute to maintaining test automation pipelines alongside engineering teams Generate structured test documentation including test cases, test plans, and coverage reports Use automation and AI tools to accelerate QA workflows and documentation Ensure releases meet quality standards before deployment Requirements Mandatory Requirements 35 years of experience in software quality assurance Strong experience in test automation using Playwright, Selenium, or similar tools Experience testing APIs using tools such as Postman Experience writing structured test cases and test documentation Strong understanding of regression testing and exploratory testing Ability to understand complex business workflows and validate system behavior Experience validating role-based systems and workflow logic Ability to generate structured test coverage reports Experience working closely with engineering teams during development cycles Familiarity with modern AI tools for improving QA productivity and documentation Good to Have Experience with Python-based automation frameworks Experience working with enterprise SaaS platforms Exposure to CI/CD pipelines and automated testing environments Experience validating database consistency and backend workflows Familiarity with procurement or workflow-driven enterprise applications What We Care About Deep workflow understanding over superficial testing Automation mindset over repetitive manual execution Clear documentation over informal test notes Curiosity and investigation over checklist testing This role is suited for someone who sees QA not as the final step in development, but as a core part of building reliable enterprise systems. \n\nDisclaimer: This job posting has been aggregated from external source. Role details, content, and availability are subject to change. Applicants are advised to confirm the latest information directly on the company website before applying.\n\nKey Skills: Procurement,Backend,Manual testing,Architecture,Enterprise applications,Workflow,Test cases,Continuous improvement"},{"title":"QA Automation & Testing Engineer","company":"Mayur Web Technology","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-qa-automation-testing-engineer-mayur-web-technology-ahmedabad-1-to-3-years-160926501895","source":"naukri","experience":"1-3 Yrs","is_walkin":false,"description":"Proficient in Manual Testing methods,Selenium automation scripts,Postman API tracking,and performance check toolsets. . Strong command of cross-platform inspection tools,relational system verifications,and professional bug tracking logs\n\nKey Skills: Software testing,Automation,Backend,Automation testing,Manual testing,Inspection,Deployment,Selenium"},{"title":"Automation Test Engineer","company":"Purview Services","location":"Ahmedabad","date_posted":"2026-09-16","url":"https://www.naukri.com/job-listings-automation-test-engineer-purview-india-consulting-and-services-l